  "status": "DRAFT for review",
  "constants": {
    "compose_tag": "x402-nonce/1\\n",
    "binding_tag": "x402-mandate-binding/1\\n",
    "anchored_payment_id_prefix": "x402n_"
  },
  "notes": [
    "authority = B per x402 PR #3220 section 7 at 72c3704; nc-01 equals that PR's published model A value.",
    "resource = keccak256(UTF8(resource) || salt) with a 32-byte salt. ILLUSTRATIVE: issue #3226 has not fixed the encoding, the salt length or where the salt is published.",
    "r3 = the paymentId matches ^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64}$, the overlap of #3220's grammar and the payment-identifier extension's. Informative: it is a proposed tightening, not part of either text yet.",
    "All other bytes derive from SHA-256('x402-nonce-composition-vectors:' + label). Test values; they hold nothing."
  ],
  "verdicts": {
    "authority": [
      "bound",
      "binding_mismatch",
      "composed_authority"
    ],
    "resource": [
      "bound",
      "member_absent",
      "member_mismatch",
      "opening_mismatch",
      "malformed_opening",
      "indeterminate"
    ]
  },
